{"synopsis":"Oleh studio Redice yang mempersembahkan Solo Leveling dan Omniscient Readers Viewpoint The World After The End dan masih banyak lagi\nAku tersummon untuk membasmi Corruption di Arad Jinsung adalah user yang telah mendedikasikan hidupnya untuk Dungeon  Fighter Dia dipanggil oleh sang Transcendent Nemyr untuk bertindak sebagai Forging Tongsnya\nKau akan menjadi Forging Tongsku untuk memandu sang blade melewati rintangannya\nAku akan menjadi Forging Tongs atau apalah itu Aku akan bertahan hidup di Arad apa pun yang terjadi\nAkankah Jinsung pemain veteran Dungeon  Fighter dapat memenuhi tugasnya dan kembali ke dunia nyata\nDemikian dimulailah kisah dark knight Jinsung untuk menghentikan akhir dari Arad","alternative_title":"아라드의 빛: 먼저 걷는 자","author":"Jegal Bokja, Lee Soo Baek","artist":"Redice Studio, Funky Creature","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"51b6dfdd-7ff3-49d7-b077-731f9aa71d6a","number":"35","chapter":"35","title":"","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27"},{"chapter_id":"9d859747-3aed-4af8-b596-88dfbb52fbe8","number":"34","chapter":"34","title":"","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27"},{"chapter_id":"619adce8-a5b4-4b79-b0b8-3966617682dd","number":"33","chapter":"33","title":"","date":"2026-07-25","released":"2026-07-25"},{"chapter_id":"6ebecaba-e369-4cdd-8611-ac9358d39e9e","number":"32","chapter":"32","title":"","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13"},{"chapter_id":"29cf6cc3-3691-4578-a981-9e73cbbe6467","number":"31","chapter":"31","title":"","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13"},{"chapter_id":"ce7e1a22-2a0d-4b60-b509-d489a47c3da7","number":"30","chapter":"30","title":"","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13"},{"chapter_id":"53421db2-f043-4a12-8deb-dcb4afafbf3e","number":"29","chapter":"29","title":"","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13"},{"chapter_id":"da33cb91-32e4-4d63-ba0b-1f47eb4e7f71","number":"28","chapter":"28","title":"","date":"2026-02-22","released":"2026-02-22"},{"chapter_id":"8d5e5977-ca02-4f9e-9776-24bee43